@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/layby#> .
@prefix road: <http://example.org/orexis/road#> .
@prefix planning: <http://example.org/orexis/planning#> .

<> a planning:ConstraintGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is

#  WHO HOLDS THE ROAD'S CONSTRAINTS (domains/road/constraints.ttl): the one courier, so it plans its van
#  neither onto the parked van's cell nor onto an obstacle's. The road states what no van does and knows no
#  agent; which agents hold it is this world's to say.

:courier_a planning:holds road:no_cell_holds_two_vans , road:no_van_on_an_obstacle .
